#: urpm/cli/main.py:739
msgid ""
"Where urpm-ng-core comes from: auto (waterfall: local match > host media > "
"github), local (force local RPM), media (force host media, fall back to "
"github with confirmation), github (force GitHub release).  Default: auto."
msgstr ""
"De dónde proviene urpm-ng-core: auto (cascada: coincidencia local > media "
"anfitrión > github), local (forzar RPM local), media (forzar media "
"anfitrión, retroceder a github con confirmación), github (forzar release de "
"GitHub). Por defecto: auto."

#: urpm/cli/main.py:747 urpm/cli/main.py:808
msgid ""
"Install urpm-ng-core from this specific RPM file, overriding --urpm-ng-"
